"What may appear to be an ordinary block of wood to you, is much, much more to these men. They are sculptors and, to them, a block of wood is a work of art waiting to be revealed to the world.": "4dbae64af684",
"What may appear to be an ordinary block of wood to you, is much, much more to these men. They are sculptors and, to them, a block of wood is a work of art waiting to be revealed to the world. In order to make their visions a reality, these sculptors will use a variety of tools. In the picture on the left, the sculptor uses a mallet and chisel to carve a beautiful fish dancing on the water's surface out of a block of wood. With these tools, he gradually chips away at the wood, slowly revealing the hidden beauty within. In the picture on the right, the sculptor is working on a depiction of a big-horned sheep. His detailed work shows a ram climbing up a mountainous, rocky cliff. For some of the more intricate details he uses a pneumatic (air) rotary-tool, which makes working in hard to reach areas much easier. Notice the orange airline that feeds air to the tool. Starting out as nothing more than plain looking chunks of wood, these sculptors have removed the outer layers, revealing truly amazing works of art within. Perhaps you will you never look at a block a wood in the same way again! Maybe you, too, will see the hidden beauty that beckons to be feed.": "71dd93a93618",
