"Whether you are an elementary school student or a doctor, you must take good care of some of your important papers. Keeping such papers in sheet protectors is a great way to both organize and protect them. Without them, your materials may become torn (ripped), wrinkled or dirty.": "2bb16ba11acf",
"Whether you are an elementary school student or a doctor, you must take good care of some of your important papers. Keeping such papers in sheet protectors is a great way to both organize and protect them. Without them, your materials may become torn (ripped), wrinkled or dirty. Look at Colby. He is preparing a presentation for his social studies class. He has a binder, in which he has organized all the papers that he needs. Each paper has been carefully placed into a sheet protector. He leafs through his work to make sure everything is in order. It is a good thing that he has done this because a couple of the pages weren’t in order. He removes them from the sheet protector and reinserts them in their correct places. Now Colby is ready for his presentation. He is confident that he will do well as he has learned that using sheet protectors will not only give his project a professional look, but more importantly, he knows that his papers will not become unorganized or get damaged. So learn from Colby: If you want to keep your school work neat and tidy, go out and stock up on sheet protectors today.": "a76850893272",
